AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/2005/05/16/pizza.owl#GoatsCheeseTopping> "CoberturaDeQueijoDeCabra	"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/2005/05/16/pizza.owl#GorgonzolaTopping> "CoberturaDeGorgonzola"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/2005/05/16/pizza.owl#GreenPepperTopping> "CoberturaDePimentaoVerde"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/2005/05/16/pizza.owl#HamTopping> "CoberturaDePresunto"@pt)
